  L  L  L  L  X  X  X  H  H  X   H  H  H  H  H  H  H  X
  H  H  H  L  L  H  L  H  L  X   L  H  H  H  H  H  L  L
  H  H  L  H  L  H  L  H  L  X   H  L  H  H  H  H  L  H
  H  H  X  X  H  H  X  H  L  X   H  H  H  H  H  H  X  X
  H  H  H  L  H  L  L  H  L  X   H  H  L  H  H  H  L  L
  H  H  H  L  L  L  L  H  L  X   H  H  H  L  H  H  L  L
  H  H  L  H  L  L  L  H  L  X   H  H  H  H  L  H  L  H
